sequenceDiagram
  participant R as InvestigationRouter
  participant L as SpecialistInvestigationLoop
  participant G as DiagnosticPolicy
  participant X as Registered read-only tools
  participant E as EvidenceCollectionService
  R->>L: selected DB-defined Specialists
  L->>G: evaluate specialist/action/budgets
  G-->>L: allow or fail closed
  L->>X: bounded tool calls
  X-->>L: structured observations
  L->>E: collect observations and provenance
  E-->>L: Evidence IDs
  L-->>R: persisted loop result and Evidence
